Package: gnome-shell-extension-louder
Version: @VERSION@
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 48)
Maintainer: Saikat Roy <saikathub95@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/saikatnjm/louder
Description: GNOME Shell extension to boost volume up to 300%
 Adds a slider to the Quick Settings menu that sets the current output
 device's volume anywhere from 0% to 300%, with the percentage shown.
